### Inscription invalide (400, erreurs par champ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "", "email": "pas-un-email", "telephone": "12", "password": "123" }

### Inscription avec un rôle interdit (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Test", "email": "x@test.com", "telephone": "690000009", "password": "Password123!", "role": "LOCATAIRE" }

### Inscription valide (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Nouveau Bailleur", "email": "nouveau@test.com", "telephone": "690000009", "password": "Password123!" }

### Même e-mail une 2e fois (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Nouveau Bailleur", "email": "nouveau@test.com", "telephone": "690000009", "password": "Password123!" }

### Connexion bailleur (copie le token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bailleur@test.com", "password": "Password123!" }

### Mauvais mot de passe (401 "Identifiants incorrects")
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bailleur@test.com", "password": "mauvais" }

### Profil courant (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sans token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Route du bailleur (200 avec token bailleur)
GET {{baseUrl}}/test/bailleur
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Route du locataire avec token bailleur (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/test/locataire
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Changer le mot de passe (400 si ancien faux)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "oldPassword": "Password123!", "newPassword": "NouveauPass123!" }

### Créer un locataire (201, bailleur seulement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/locataires
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Locataire Deux", "email": "locataire2@test.com", "telephone": "690000010", "password": "Provisoire123!" }

### Test complet : inscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Awa Bailleur", "email": "awa@test.com", "telephone": "690000020", "password": "Password123!" }

### Test 1 : inscription 
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"nom": "Marcel bailleur", "email": "marcel@yahoo.fr", "telephone":"675369384", "password": "password1234!" }

### R1 connexion
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bailleur@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### R2 me
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### R3 renouvellement
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}